      "post_id": "500285962342367232",
      "text": "The #Ferguson police dept didn't say \"murdered\" of course. Cops never \"murder\" people. Black people just \"are shot\" in proximity of cops",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 14:20:42 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500315414640197632",
      "text": "@BernardKingIII murder requires *intent* to *kill,* doubt even bad bigots would think present snafu worth that",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 16:17:44 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.003128107697439e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500287317358411777",
      "text": ". @mollycrabapple @ingdamnit They don't even *do* anything. Things just happen \"in connection with\" them. In the passive voice.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 14:26:06 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.002859623423672e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500438503730446336",
      "text": "@mollycrabapple in beaver creek Ohio police shot a black male and ARE calling it murder. So should Ferguson.",
