    },
    {
      "post_id": "500289035966095361",
      "text": "@mollycrabapple Has a cop ever been convicted of murder due to a shooting in the line of duty? Cursory Google search turned up nothing.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 14:32:55 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.002859623423672e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500286126628671488",
      "text": "@mollycrabapple Cop just pulled the trigger on a gun, which happened to fire a bullet, which incidentally hit someone. Completely unrelated.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 14:21:22 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.002859623423672e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500316879957684225",
      "text": "@un_pellegrino That's not just officers, that applies to everyone too.",
